# PROJECT VISION

Astro-KALI is not intended to be a normal astrology application.

The goal is to create an AI-powered Vedic Astrology Intelligence Platform capable of:

- Generating accurate Vedic charts
- Applying thousands of classical astrology rules
- Explaining every prediction
- Supporting AI analysis
- Supporting local LLMs
- Supporting cloud APIs
- Multi-person analysis
- Group analysis
- Research mode
- Transit forecasting
- Timeline simulation
- Explainable reasoning

The system must never produce random astrology text.

Every prediction must be traceable to actual chart calculations and rules.

